	(descr "nRF24L01+ 'Mini SMD' module, single row of 8 castellated pads at 1.27mm pitch, 12x18mm body (also fits the 12x19mm Ebyte E01-ML01S). Pad order VCC(+3.3V), GND, CE, CSN, SCK, MOSI, MISO, IRQ. Geometry and pad order verified against the vendor dimension drawing for Sunrom model 3962 (https://www.sunrom.com/p/rf-module-2-4ghz-nrf24l01-smd), which gives 12x18mm, 1.27mm pitch, first pad centre 1.6mm from the edge (this footprint: 1.555mm -- 0.045mm inside a 0.95mm-wide pad, immaterial). Note these modules are NOT standardised between sellers: other vendors ship the same body with VCC/GND in different positions, so re-verify before using this footprint with a different source. Antenna end is -Y from the pad row -- keep that end, plus a small margin, completely free of copper (pour, tracks, vias).")
